• Code: `name = caps.get(2) -> None -> "", then if name.is_empty() → caps.get(1) -> "point"` ✓

For typedef struct point:
• Group 1 = "point", group 2 = None
• Same path: falls back to group 1 → "point" ✓

So the logic is correct (it's a bit redundant — always using group 2 then falling back — but it works). Good.

